      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ON THE PROWL (6) jumped well to win over the 515m at Sandown two runs back then settled forward again when finishing second at Sandown last start. Yet to miss the placings from three starts out of this box. Winning claims. OPAWA FANNIN (8) could manage only fifth at Sandown last time but impressed when clocking an excellent 29.29 over 515m at Sandown the start prior. Must include on winning run two back. STIDHAM ARIZONA (5) has a strong record this trip with four wins and three placings from 11 starts. Recorded a head win (29.43) in a Special conditions race last time at Sandown. Looks a key chance on best figures. EXACTLY LIKE DAD (1) hit the frame latest (30.46) when third at this track in a Grade 4/5. Unbeaten in three runs from this draw.",
